# Google Maps JS API key. Origin-restricted to the deployed site, so it's
# safe to ship in the client bundle — Vite needs the `VITE_` prefix to expose
# it. Without this set, MapBox falls back to the schematic SVG placeholder.
#
# Local dev: copy this file to `.env` (or `.env.local`) and fill in the value.
# CI: stored as the `GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY` repo secret, passed through in
# `.github/workflows/deploy-gh-pages.yml`.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
